\item \code{facet}: Repeats the column once per level, on one scale. At most 15 levels, 300 for tiles. Default \code{NULL}: no facet.
\item \code{show}: The mark. "tile" is a square cell, offered with look = "compact". One of \code{"bar"}, \code{"number"}, \code{"dot"}, \code{"tile"}. Default: \code{"bar"}.
\item \code{func}: Aggregation per row group. An unknown value is an error. One of \code{"count"}, \code{"count_distinct"}, \code{"sum"}, \code{"mean"}, \code{"median"}, \code{"min"}, \code{"max"}, \code{"identity"}. Default: \code{"count"}.
