\item \code{position}: Layout of a color split on a bar. One of \code{"stack"}, \code{"dodge"}, \code{"fill"}. Default \code{NULL}: by the measure.
\item \code{fill}: Tile only. The cell is painted by the worst level of this column (factor order, numeric order, else sorted). Default \code{NULL}: value ramp.
\item \code{color}: Color split, at most 15 levels. Default \code{NULL}: no color split.
}

\strong{\code{type = "dist"}}
\itemize{
\item \code{name}: Column header. Default \code{NULL}: auto ("Rows", "Mean AGE").
\item \code{facet}: Repeats the column once per level, on one scale. At most 15 levels, 300 for tiles. Default \code{NULL}: no facet.
\item \code{show}: The mark, or the statistic as text. One of \code{"pointrange"}, \code{"box"}, \code{"text"}. Default: \code{"pointrange"}.
\item \code{col}: Numeric column summarized. Required.
\item \code{summary}: Center and inner range, as the chart's \code{summary}. With show = "text" it is the printed statistic. One of \code{"median_q1_q3"}, \code{"mean_sd"}, \code{"mean_2sd"}, \code{"mean_se"}, \code{"mean_ci95"}, \code{"p5_p95"}, \code{"p10_p90"}, \code{"min_max"}, \code{"none"}. Default: \code{"median_q1_q3"}.
\item \code{whiskers}: Outer range, as the chart's \code{whiskers}. One of \code{"tukey"}, \code{"median_q1_q3"}, \code{"mean_sd"}, \code{"mean_2sd"}, \code{"mean_se"}, \code{"mean_ci95"}, \code{"p5_p95"}, \code{"p10_p90"}, \code{"min_max"}, \code{"none"}. Default \code{NULL}: Tukey on a box, none on a dot range.
\item \code{color}: Color split, at most 15 levels. Default \code{NULL}: no color split.
}

\strong{\code{type = "field"}}
\itemize{
\item \code{name}: Column header. Default \code{NULL}: auto ("Rows", "Mean AGE").
\item \code{col}: Distinct values joined: up to 3, then "+n more"; over 8, "n values". Required.
}

\strong{\code{type = "sparkline"}}
\itemize{
\item \code{name}: Column header. Default \code{NULL}: auto ("Rows", "Mean AGE").
\item \code{facet}: Repeats the column once per level, on one scale. At most 15 levels, 300 for tiles. Default \code{NULL}: no facet.
\item \code{x}: Numeric column the line runs along. Required.
\item \code{col}: Numeric column drawn. Required.
\item \code{ymin}: Lower end of a band behind the line. Both or neither. Default \code{NULL}: no band.
\item \code{ymax}: Upper end of the band. Default \code{NULL}: no band.
\item \code{summary}: Reference band behind the line. One of \code{"none"}, \code{"mean"}, \code{"mean_sd"}, \code{"median_q1_q3"}. Default: \code{"none"}.
}

\strong{\code{type = "spans"}}
\itemize{
\item \code{name}: Column header. Default \code{NULL}: auto ("Rows", "Mean AGE").
\item \code{facet}: Repeats the column once per level, on one scale. At most 15 levels, 300 for tiles. Default \code{NULL}: no facet.
\item \code{x}: Interval start, numeric or date, as the chart's gantt. Required.
\item \code{xend}: Interval end. Required.
\item \code{label}: Headlines the tooltip and keys the same-event highlight. Default \code{NULL}: no label.
\item \code{tooltip}: Extra columns in the tooltip. Default \code{NULL}: no extra columns.
\item \code{size}: Segment thickness. One of \code{"md"}, \code{"lg"}. Default: \code{"md"}.
\item \code{color}: Color split, at most 15 levels. Default \code{NULL}: no color split.
\item \code{ticks}: Positions drawn as thin ticks across the lane (visits). Read from the rows where it is set, so tick rows can sit in the same frame. Default \code{NULL}: no ticks.
\item \code{band_x}: Start of a dark line through the middle of the lane (a duration of response). Both or neither. Default \code{NULL}: no band.
\item \code{band_xend}: End of the line. Default \code{NULL}: no band.
\item \code{event_x}: Positions of point events, which may lie past the last segment (a death after treatment end). Default \code{NULL}: no events.
\item \code{event_shape}: Event kind. Its levels take, in order, a filled triangle, an open triangle, a cross and a square; further levels repeat them. Names the event in the tooltip and the legend. Default \code{NULL}: one shape.
\item \code{open}: Logical. TRUE on any of a row's records draws an arrowhead at the end of its last segment (still ongoing). Default \code{NULL}: no arrow.
